  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Narration places him among Miao Ming Shen’s followers with Immortal Hua Die and Feng Jiang. He and Miao Ming Shen hold rank seven cultivation while Hua Die and Feng Jiang are rank six, though Miao Ming Shen has the greatest battle strength in the group.",
      "chapters": [
        1154
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_miao_ming_shen",
        "char_immortal_hua_die",
        "char_feng_jiang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With Immortal Hua Die and Feng Jiang he takes turns guarding the turbulent flow sea area and asking approaching Gu Immortals for help seeking a tributary of the River of Time.",
      "chapters": [
        1154
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "turbulent-flow-sea-watch",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_tributary_of_the_river_of_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Ren Xiu Ping tries to assassinate Miao Ming Shen with an ice poison starfish, Gui Qi Ye blocks the fatal attack, falls unconscious under purple poison, and is later cleansed with underworld yellow water. After waking he urges Miao Ming Shen to invite carefully chosen reinforcements to explore the blue dragon whale rather than wait for Ren Xiu Ping to gather more people.",
      "chapters": [
        1648
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ice-poison-starfish",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ren_xiu_ping"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Miao Ming Shen lists him among the eight on the trip and among those he trusts most with Feng Jiang and Immortal Hua Die.",
      "chapters": [
        1650
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blue-dragon-whale-trip",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside the blue dragon whale he claims a hard mission ahead of Fang Yuan under the Chu Ying identity, then apologizes to Miao Ming Shen afterward. With Miao Ming Shen and Fang Yuan he is one of the three remaining rank sevens choosing among Merit Obelisk missions.",
      "chapters": [
        1652
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "merit-missions",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "house_merit_obelisk"
      ]
    }
  ],
